# Avenger of the Fallen: "Mobilize X, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard." Its ruling: "The value of X is
# calculated only once, as Avenger of the Fallen's mobilize ability resolves" (CR 608.2h). One Memnite is in Bot1's graveyard when
# the Avenger attacks; in response to the trigger Bot2 bolts the other, so X is 2 when it resolves, not 1.

